AOZUMI Agents

AOZUMI Agents is a modified version of Cloudroom GUI
(https://github.com/davidondrej/cloudroom-gui), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). Cloudroom GUI is in turn based on BB, whose
MIT notice appears above and is retained.

Modifications by AOZUMI Labs, 2026:
- Cloud threads run on AOZUMI Agents: AOZUMI device sign-in, one AOZUMI agent
  (its own sandbox) per cloud thread, and core access through AOZUMI's
  authenticated pass-through.
- Features that depend on Cloudroom's hosted services are turned off.
- The product is renamed AOZUMI Agents, with its own bundle identifier, URL
  scheme, data folder, update feed, and original icons. The Cloudroom name and
  artwork are not used for this product.

Files changed from the original carry this notice through this NOTICE file and
the version history of this repository.

